-- title:
--   Canonical original BV physical-grid HJB residual plus cofinal stopped compensator has nonpositive expectation
-- statement:
--   For the exact canonical original X,D, uniform physical grid and B_n source with hB and hBI, Proved original B expected-sign and Proved cofinal centred stopped X.nu compensated source jointly yield an integrable sum with nonpositive expectation on the identical physical grid. This is a source-exact signed expectation theorem; the pathwise payoff inequality and positive-error decay remain open.
